    "# EfficientNetB0: Results and Discussion\n",
    "\n",
    "## Architecture and Transfer Learning\n",
    "EfficientNetB0 uses a pretrained ImageNet backbone and a newly added classification head for the ten Fashion-MNIST classes. The backbone is initially frozen, after which selected layers are fine-tuned with a lower learning rate.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Performance\n",
    "EfficientNetB0 achieved a test accuracy of `[insert measured result]%`, weighted precision of `[value]`, and weighted recall of `[value]`. The confusion matrix identifies the categories that are most frequently misclassified.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Resource Requirements\n",
    "The model contains `[parameter count]` parameters, with a saved model size of `[value]` MB. Its measured average training time per epoch was `[value]` seconds on the experimental hardware.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Limitations\n",
    "Although EfficientNetB0 uses pretrained features, its computational and memory requirements may be greater than those of the custom lightweight CNN. Results depend on the dataset, input resolution, training configuration, and hardware. The model should be compared with MobileNetV2, Model A, and Model B using the same evaluation criteria."
